WEBVTT

00:03:29.746 --> 00:03:33.163
In fact, being stationary for long
periods with good posture

00:03:33.204 --> 00:03:38.163
can be worse than regular movement
with bad posture.

00:03:38.204 --> 00:03:40.746
When you do move, move smartly.

00:03:40.788 --> 00:03:43.288
Keep anything you're carrying
close to your body.

00:03:43.329 --> 00:03:47.579
Backpacks should be in contact
with your back carried symetrically.

00:03:47.621 --> 00:03:50.746
If you sit a lot, get up 
and move around on occasion

00:03:50.788 --> 00:03:53.329
and be sure to exercise.

00:03:53.621 --> 00:03:57.954
Using your muscles will keep them
strong enough to support you effectively,

00:03:57.996 --> 00:04:03.288
on top of all the other benefits
to your joints, bones, brain and heart.